[06/08/26 13:38:31] INFO     Transcription:  For example, take the   base.py:98
                             expression 2a plus 5b plus 3a plus b.             
                             We rearrange to place the a terms                 
                             together and the b terms together. 2a             
                             plus 3a plus 5b plus b. Now we combine.           
                             2a plus 3a is 5a and 5b plus b is 6b.             
                             The simplified expression is 5a plus              
                             6b. Rearranging never changes the value           
                             of the expression. It simply makes                
                             simplification easier.                            
